BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Night: Boyhood (2014)
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260808T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260808T220000
UID:132411c6d8a9a24fa786d692@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Boyhood follows one boy’s life from childhood to early adult
 hood\, filmed with the same actors over twelve years. In a series of ordin
 ary moments\, the film quietly reveals how time\, family\, and experience 
 shape a life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/film-night-boyhood-2014-
 08-aug-2026
END:VEVENT
